editor_description = "A stone tomb chest (tools/build/prop_abbey_church.py), 2.2 x 1 m and 0.85 m high, weepers in the arcading of its long sides. Its lid is cracked across: one half lies askew over the west end (-X), the other stands where it fell behind the chest (-Z); the east half is open and black, to climb into. Its +Z side is the one seen. The hidden Blocks are its collision."

